WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.845
Watch and read: How do you spell the word “cat”?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.571
The answer is: cat. Check the order of sounds and letters.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.629
Watch and read: Fill the first missing letter: _at

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.610
The answer is: c. Say the word aloud and listen for the missing sound.
